# Normalise line endings to LF in the repository and check them out in the
# platform's own convention.
#
# This matters here: R writes platform-native line endings, and
# tests/test_outputs.R compares regenerated CSVs against the committed ones
# byte-for-byte. Without this, the test outcome would depend on each
# contributor's core.autocrlf setting rather than on the numbers.
* text=auto

*.R   text
*.csv text
*.md  text
*.cff text

*.png binary
*.pdf binary
*.xlsx binary
